<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank calls news conference.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank calls news conference.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) called a news conference for 9 p.m. (1900 GMT) on Monday, a bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>CNB governor Josef Tosovsky said earlier that the bank would eliminate the fluctuation band within which the crown moves against a mark/dollar basket, effective Tuesday.</p>
<p>The CNB spokesman said details of the move would be explained at the news conference.</p>
</text>
